{"title":"2013 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1c","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2013 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Charlie is 30 years older than his daughter Bella. Charlie is also six times as old as Bella. Determine Charlie’s age.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> be Bella's age in years. Since Charlie is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> years older than her, Charlie must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/f/b7fef9cace4587ebc657961a05769589841065f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" /> years old. Charlie is also <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times as old as Bella, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/1/fa1965200379f82e9d00f1eb254a35122440ed5d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6b = b + 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/7/2b7bc71ccf084dc407a8f86c15a8c9542b5ae32f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6b - b = 5b = 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"132\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/4/254ac5bb87c1157dd09252544e6797dae200d2dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\frac{30}{5} = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"89\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Since Charlie is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> years older than this, he must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/e/58e2a0a12e7b418613f025e15fcd73800401506d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30 + 6 = \\boxed{36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"105\" height=\"25\" /> years old.\n</p><p>Alternatively, since he is also <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times as old as Bella, he must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/2/0428eb5376b4abd97f8c47f77ece387f16eb1261.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 \\times 6 = \\boxed{36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"96\" height=\"25\" /> years old.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> be Charlie's age in years. Since Charlie is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> years older than Bella, Bella must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/f/34f2b0d2baa8be51ca27c4721635210999684b77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c - 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" /> years old. Charlie is also <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times as old as Bella, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/a/79a79c926e1bb7c2114ae7c462d8e593540354bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6(c - 30) = c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"105\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/7/a473483d37f0c2424b0c39b46adacfdf4eae2dc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6c - 6 \\times 30 = c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"123\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/b/44b71f22db807f5c15edeb91f5911f2448e91a99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6c - 180 = c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"100\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/a/57a359ee94dde9e26e95a74d76669645450acf46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6c - c = 0 + 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"132\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/2/9f223f0ee69e19fad0c1592789cf80cdfcfc6c67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5c = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"70\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/9/4f99d3da6be7344cd9323919cce65a53c8ee94ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = \\frac{180}{5} = \\boxed{36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"119\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017232330\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.029 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 98/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3790/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.154      1 2013_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    6.154      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36030:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017232330 and revision id 279701. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}